OL,3,GNEWSAGlass Centre listing bid turned
OL,4,Adown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to achieve listed status for the
OL,7,Fdoomed National Glass Centre (NGC) has
OL,8,Fbeen turned down.
OL,10,FThe government said the building lacked
OL,11,F"sufficient architectural [or]
OL,12,Fhistorical interest to warrant
OL,13,Flisting", while Historic England said
OL,14,Falterations to the "visually bold"
OL,15,FSunderland venue had "eroded" its
OL,16,Foriginal design concept.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
