OL,3,GNEWSAGlass Centre listing bid turned
OL,4,Adown
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunderland University, which has plans
OL,7,Fto demolish the centre, said it would
OL,8,Fcontinue to comply with planning
OL,9,Frequirements, while Historic England
OL,10,Fbacked the university's application for
OL,11,Fimmunity from listing.
OL,13,FThe Save the National Glass Centre
OL,14,Fcampaign group said it would be making
OL,15,Ffurther representations to the
OL,16,FDepartment for Digital, Culture, Media
OL,17,Fand Sport (DCMS).
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
